<div id="vps">
<div class="wrap">
  <header>
    <a class="back" id="vps-backlink" href="#" hidden>← All displays</a>
    <h1 id="vps-studio-title">Display Studio</h1>
    <p class="sub" id="vps-studio-sub">Pick the kind of display you're making.</p>
  </header>

  <nav class="dpick" id="vps-dpick" aria-label="Display types">
    <a class="dcard" href="#cross"><img alt="Wooden cross on a warm glow" src="data:image/jpeg;base64,"><h2>Cross Display</h2><p>Wooden and glowing crosses. Choose the cross, the wood, and what's shown behind it.</p><span class="go">Design a cross →</span><span class="tag">LATIN · CELTIC · WOODEN · AND MORE</span></a>
    <a class="dcard" href="#portal"><img alt="Blue swirling vortex portal" src="data:image/jpeg;base64,"><h2>Portal Display</h2><p>Swirling portals. Choose the style, colours and motion.</p><span class="go">Design a portal →</span><span class="tag">VORTEX · TOON SPIRAL · STARBURST · CARTOON SWIRL</span></a>
    <a class="dcard" href="#space"><img alt="Spiral galaxy" src="data:image/jpeg;base64,"><h2>Space Display</h2><p>Galaxies, nebulas and flying through the stars. Choose the scene and colours.</p><span class="go">Design a space scene →</span><span class="tag">HYPERSPACE · GALAXY · NEBULA · METEOR SHOWER</span></a>
    <a class="dcard" href="#picture"><img alt="A sunset photo on the 3.5 inch display, with a play button" src="data:image/jpeg;base64,"><h2>Picture Display</h2><p>Your own photos, GIFs and videos, with sound. For the 3.5″ and 4.0″ displays.</p><span class="go">Make a picture show →</span><span class="tag">PHOTOS · GIFS · VIDEOS</span></a>
  </nav>

  <div id="vps-picpage" hidden>
    <div class="pd-cols">
      <div class="col">
        <section class="card" aria-label="Picture preview">
          <h2>Preview</h2>
          <div class="pd-boardbox">
            <div class="pd-board"><div class="pd-glass"><canvas class="pd-scr" id="vps-pd-scr" width="480" height="320" aria-label="The display, showing your pictures"></canvas></div></div>
            <div class="pd-under">
              <span class="pd-now" id="vps-pd-now">Add something to see it here</span>
              <button class="b ghost" id="vps-pd-play" type="button">▶ Play the whole show</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="pd-hint" id="vps-pd-draghint" hidden>Drag the picture on the screen to move it, and use Zoom to get closer.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="card" aria-label="Your display">
          <h2>Your display</h2>
          <div class="pd-row">
            <span class="pd-lab">Board</span>
            <span class="seg" id="vps-pd-boardseg"><button type="button" data-v="cyd35" aria-pressed="true">3.5″ E32R35T</button><button type="button" data-v="cyd40" aria-pressed="false">4.0″ E32R40T</button></span>
          </div>
          <div class="pd-row">
            <span class="pd-lab">Screen</span>
            <span class="seg" id="vps-pd-orient"><button type="button" data-v="land" aria-pressed="true">Sideways</button><button type="button" data-v="port" aria-pressed="false">Upright</button></span>
          </div>
          <div class="pd-row">
            <span class="pd-lab">Between pictures</span>
            <span class="seg" id="vps-pd-trans"><button type="button" data-v="fade" aria-pressed="true">Fade</button><button type="button" data-v="cut" aria-pressed="false">Cut</button></span>
            <label class="pd-ctl" style="min-width:160px;flex:1" id="vps-pd-fadewrap"><span>Fade <output id="vps-pd-o-fade">1.0 s</output></span><input id="vps-pd-fade" type="range" min="0.3" max="3" step="0.1" value="1"></label>
          </div>
          <div class="pd-row">
            <span class="pd-lab">Video sound</span>
            <label class="pd-ctl" style="min-width:160px;flex:1"><span>Volume <output id="vps-pd-o-vol">80%</output></span><input id="vps-pd-vol" type="range" min="0" max="100" step="5" value="80"></label>
          </div>
          <div class="pd-row">
            <label class="pd-chk"><input type="checkbox" id="vps-pd-shuffle"> Shuffle the order on the board</label>
          </div>
          <p class="pd-hint">Sound plays through the board's speaker socket (a small 8 Ω speaker with a 2-pin plug). Tap the screen to skip to the next picture.</p>
        </section>
        <div id="vps-pd-board-slot"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="col">
        <section class="card" aria-label="Pictures, GIFs and videos">
          <h2>Pictures, GIFs and videos</h2>
          <div class="pd-drop" id="vps-pd-drop">
            <b>Drop photos, GIFs or videos here</b>
            <small>JPG, PNG, GIF, MP4, WebM or MOV. Each one is fitted to the screen.</small>
            <label class="pd-pick">Choose files<input class="pd-vh" id="vps-pd-files" type="file" accept="image/*,video/*" multiple></label>
          </div>
          <div class="pd-items" id="vps-pd-items"><div class="pd-empty">Nothing added yet.</div></div>
        </section>

        <section class="card" aria-label="Edit" id="vps-pd-edit" hidden>
          <h2 id="vps-pd-edit-title">Edit</h2>
          <div class="pd-grid">
            <label class="pd-ctl"><span>Fit</span><select id="vps-pd-fit"><option value="fill">Fill the screen (crops the edges)</option><option value="fit">Whole picture (bars at the sides)</option></select></label>
            <label class="pd-ctl"><span>Zoom <output id="vps-pd-o-zoom"></output></span><input id="vps-pd-zoom" type="range" min="1" max="3" step="0.05"></label>
            <label class="pd-ctl" data-pdkind="photo"><span>Show for <output id="vps-pd-o-secs"></output></span><input id="vps-pd-secs" type="range" min="2" max="60" step="1"><small>How long this photo stays up</small></label>
            <label class="pd-ctl" data-pdkind="gif"><span>Play it <output id="vps-pd-o-plays"></output></span><input id="vps-pd-plays" type="range" min="1" max="10" step="1"><small>How many times the GIF runs before the next picture</small></label>
            <label class="pd-ctl" data-pdkind="video"><span>Start <output id="vps-pd-o-start"></output></span><input id="vps-pd-start" type="range" min="0" max="1" step="0.1"></label>
            <label class="pd-ctl" data-pdkind="video"><span>End <output id="vps-pd-o-end"></output></span><input id="vps-pd-end" type="range" min="0" max="1" step="0.1"><small>Only this part of the video goes on the board</small></label>
            <label class="pd-ctl" data-pdkind="video gif"><span>Smoothness <output id="vps-pd-o-fps"></output></span><input id="vps-pd-fps" type="range" min="4" max="12" step="1"><small>More frames a second look smoother but use more memory</small></label>
            <label class="pd-chk" data-pdkind="video"><input type="checkbox" id="vps-pd-sound"> Play its sound</label>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="card" aria-label="Board memory">
          <h2>Board memory</h2>
          <div class="pd-meter" id="vps-pd-meter"></div>
          <div class="pd-memtxt"><span id="vps-pd-memused">0 MB used</span><b id="vps-pd-memfree">2.2 MB free</b></div>
          <div class="pd-legend"><span><i style="background:#e8a92c"></i>Photos</span><span><i style="background:#8a4fd8"></i>GIFs</span><span><i style="background:#3a7bd5"></i>Videos</span><span><i style="background:#2fa36b"></i>Sound</span></div>
          <p class="pd-hint">The board keeps about 2.2 MB: roughly 50 photos, or about 20 seconds of video. Sizes here are estimates until you send.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="card" aria-label="Send to the display">
          <h2>Send to the display</h2>
          <ol class="pd-steps">
            <li><b>Install on my board</b> (in Put it on your board). Needed once, so the board has the Picture Display.</li>
            <li><b>Connect over USB.</b></li>
            <li><b>Send to the display.</b> About a minute when the board is full.</li>
          </ol>
          <div class="btns"><button class="b" id="vps-pd-send" type="button">Send to the display</button></div>
          <div class="pbar" id="vps-pd-bar" hidden>
            <div class="pbar-top"><span id="vps-pd-stage"><b>Step 1 of 3</b></span><span id="vps-pd-pct"></span></div>
            <div class="pbar-track" role="progressbar" aria-labelledby="pd-stage" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" id="vps-pd-track"><div class="pbar-fill" id="vps-pd-fill"></div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="status" id="vps-pd-status" role="status"></div>
          <p class="pd-hint">Sending replaces the show already on the board. It also clears pictures saved there for scenes, since they share the same memory.</p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

